==Dungeon denizens==
The Cathedral, the center-left entrance, consists of two sections: the [[Chapel Gardens]]; and the [[Crusader's Chapel]] with the bosses [[Scarlet Commander Mograine]] and [[High Inquisitor Whitemane]]. [[High Inquisitor Fairbanks]] is hidden in a concealed chamber of the Crusader's Chapel.  
